.DS_Store

# SECURITY: saved browser auth state (cookies + localStorage from save_browser_session).
# Must never be committed — the built-in commit button does `git add -A`, so one careless
# commit would put live auth tokens into history on a repo with remotes.
.v3code/browser-sessions/

